WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:18.197
What should the checker reject?

00:18.197 --> 00:32.863
Evidence for p is not evidence for q.

00:32.863 --> 00:51.145
Compare terms, not spellings.

00:51.145 --> 01:08.010
Unsupported forms are refused.

01:08.010 --> 01:23.874
A checked theorem has a boundary.

01:23.874 --> 01:42.592
Keep both outcomes in view.
